    "description": "HP, MP, Stamina, Silver, Selected Item Amount, and game speed. Player stats use pointer chains — no scan needed. Economy values need a one-time scan per session.",
    "tags": ["Action", "RPG"],
    "executable": "CrimsonDesert.exe",
    "notes": "Singleplayer only — Pearl Abyss confirmed no anti-cheat in SP mode. HP, MP, and Stamina resolve automatically via pointer chains. Silver and item amounts require a scan once per session using the Find Address wizard."
  },
